    "created_at": "2021-10-15T03:05:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-15T03:05:05Z",
    "body": "I understand they can't be changed now, and of course you can re-purpose this issue for that.\r\n\r\nFor my last question, my understanding is that `inferface`s map to JavaScript `class`es, and `dictionary`-ies are plain JavaScript objects. For these return values with no behavior (methods), dictionaries should be used because plain objects are slightly faster. Is that right?",
