    "created_at": "2021-10-15T19:00:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-15T19:00:25Z",
    "body": "I'm not familiar with the particular performance characteristics of interfaces vs. dictionaries in different Javascript implementations. In both specification language and Blink/V8 it is significantly simpler to work with a dictionary than an interface.",
